---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Max Vogt">
  <main class="page-container">
    <header class="section-pad fade-up">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <label class="toggle text-base">
          <a class="text-[1.25rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] hover:text-[var(--color-primary)]" href="/">Max.</a>
          <input type="checkbox" aria-label="Toggle dark mode" data-theme-toggle />
          <span class="toggle-icons" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="toggle-icon icon-moon">◑</span>
          </span>
        </label>
        <nav class="flex items-center gap-8 text-base">
          <a class="nav-link transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[var(--color-primary)]" href="/">Work</a>
          <a class="nav-link transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[var(--color-primary)]" href="/about">About</a>
          <a
            class="nav-link transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[var(--color-primary)]"
            href="https://www.instagram.com/maaxvogt/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
          >
            Fun
          </a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="section-pad fade-up delay-1">
      <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.05fr,0.95fr] md:items-start">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
          <h1 class="text-[clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem)] text-[var(--color-secondary)]">Hey there,</h1>
          <h1 class="text-[clamp(3.2rem,6vw,5.2rem)]">I'm Max.</h1>
          <p class="text-muted max-w-[40rem]">
            I’m a software engineer and product-minded builder who enjoys working on problems where
            technical correctness, real-world constraints, and human decision-making intersect.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted max-w-[40rem]">
            My background spans software engineering, applied AI, security, and product development —
            often in contexts where reliability and clarity matter more than novelty. Over the years,
            I’ve worked on everything from developer tooling and ML systems to compliance automation and
            security assessments, frequently taking projects from early concept through production and
            long-term ownership.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted max-w-[40rem]">
            I’m particularly drawn to building systems that are explainable, maintainable, and useful
            in practice, whether the audience is engineers, business stakeholders, or end users.
          </p>
          <a class="nav-link text-base" href="/resume.pdf" download>→ Resume</a>
        </div>
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl md:col-start-2 md:self-start max-h-[520px]">
          <img src="/images/profilePicture.JPG" alt="Portrait of Max Vogt" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-pad">
      <div class="case-row">
        <h2 class="case-title">What I Care About</h2>
        <div class="case-body">
          <p class="text-muted">
            I care about engineering judgment — knowing when to introduce complexity and when to remove it.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted">Across my projects, I tend to focus on:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-muted space-y-2">
            <li>Deterministic systems before heuristic or AI-driven solutions</li>
            <li>Clear interfaces between humans and software</li>
            <li>Long-term maintainability over short-term optimization</li>
            <li>Tools and products that respect the user’s attention and trust</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-muted">
            I believe the best software feels obvious in hindsight, even if it wasn’t obvious to build.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-pad">
      <div class="case-row">
        <h2 class="case-title">Experience Highlights</h2>
        <div class="case-body">
          <p class="font-semibold">Founder & Software Engineer</p>
          <p class="text-muted uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs">XIT — 2020 to 2023</p>
          <p class="text-muted">
            I founded and later sold a subscription-based web services company focused on small and
            medium-sized businesses. I was responsible for the full lifecycle — from client acquisition
            and product design to engineering, hosting, and long-term maintenance. This experience shaped
            how I think about ownership, trade-offs, and building systems that actually survive in the
            real world.
          </p>

          <p class="font-semibold mt-4">Software Engineer (Applied Automation & AI)</p>
          <p class="text-muted uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs">Clean Controlling — Project-Based</p>
          <p class="text-muted">
            I designed and implemented an automated document monitoring system that detects regulatory
            changes, summarizes them using AI, and distributes actionable updates to stakeholders. The
            work emphasized auditability, correctness, and explainability in compliance-sensitive workflows.
          </p>

          <p class="font-semibold mt-4">Security & Penetration Testing</p>
          <p class="text-muted uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs">Poddie — Authorized Engagement</p>
          <p class="text-muted">
            I conducted an authorized penetration test and translated technical findings into practical
            risk assessments and remediation guidance for non-technical stakeholders, bridging the gap
            between security engineering and decision-making.
          </p>

          <p class="font-semibold mt-4">Developer Tooling & ML Projects</p>
          <p class="text-muted uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs">Independent Projects</p>
          <p class="text-muted">
            I’ve built developer-facing tools (including a VS Code extension for structured commit
            messages), machine learning systems for sports analytics, and small UX-focused experiments.
            These projects reflect my interest in clarity, feedback loops, and thoughtful system design
            at different scales.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-pad">
      <div class="case-row">
        <h2 class="case-title">Outside of Code</h2>
        <div class="case-body">
          <p class="text-muted">
            I enjoy working on projects that balance technical depth with design and usability, and
            I’m always curious about how people interact with systems — especially when decisions,
            trust, or constraints are involved.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted">
            I’m currently looking for environments where I can contribute as an engineer while
            continuing to grow in system design, product thinking, and technical leadership.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-pad">
      <div class="case-row">
        <h2 class="case-title text-[var(--color-secondary)]">Other.</h2>
        <div class="case-body">
          <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr,1fr]">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
              <h3 class="text-xl">What I'm listening to</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">
              <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl aspect-square">
                <img src="/images/music_1.jpg" alt="Music cover 1" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
              </div>
              <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl aspect-square">
                <img src="/images/music_2.jpg" alt="Music cover 2" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
              </div>
              <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl aspect-square">
                <img src="/images/music_3.jpg" alt="Music cover 3" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr,1fr]">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
              <h3 class="text-xl">What I'm watching</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">
              <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl aspect-square">
                <img src="/images/movie_1.jpg" alt="Movie cover 1" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
              </div>
              <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl aspect-square">
                <img src="/images/movie_2.jpg" alt="Movie cover 2" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
              </div>
              <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl aspect-square">
                <img src="/images/movie_3.jpg" alt="Movie cover 3" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-pad">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <h2>Let's get in touch</h2>
        <p class="text-muted">
          HMU for work, coffee, or if you just want to talk.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-6 text-sm">
          <a
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-transparent transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-[var(--color-primary)]"
            href="https://github.com/maaxvogt/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
          >
            GitHub
          </a>
          <a
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-transparent transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-[var(--color-primary)]"
            href="mailto:mavoxgt@gmail.com"
          >
            Mail
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted">Designed and coded by Max Vogt</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
